# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Vendored game DLLs. The publicized STUB (Assembly-CSharp.dll — method
# signatures only via `assembly-publicizer --strip`, no game IL) IS committed
# so CI can build the release; everything else under lib/ stays ignored.
**/lib/*
!**/lib/Assembly-CSharp.dll

# IDE / editor
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Local convenience
*.local
__pycache__/
